            "review_title": "Review at Two Schmucks",
            "review_text": "SameerKumar\nSingapore, Singapore210 contributions\n0\nGreat price for drinks and nice Jazz music\nApr 2024 • Solo\nI didn't try a lot of bars at Hanoi. But out of 3 or may be 5 that I tried, this was the best. Cocktail menu looked nice, though I didn't try anything from that. Not too pricey for whisky and other spirits. Chocolate stout was nice. Unique taste.\n\nI went there on Friday (quite late). They had Jazz night and live performance by a group. Amazing!\n\nThe food menu was limited. But the Jazz more than mde up for it.\nRead more\nWritten April 12, 2024",
            "rating": 3.0,
