            "review_text": "Coll\nHanoi, Vietnam59 contributions\n0\nGreat experience & cocktails to love!\nMar 2024 • Friends\nWhat a fantastic experience!! My friends and I spent a great evening taking part in a Cocktail Master Class. We learned lots about the history and the making of cocktails. Highly recommended - if you’re in Hanoi - it’s a great experience- or even just to go for an expertly crafted cocktail!! You’ll love it!\nWritten March 23, 2024",
