            "review_title": "Review at Two Schmucks",
            "review_text": "TanjungBaraDiver\nHanoi, Vietnam1974 contributions\n0\nI know we were pretty early, but still...\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nWe were on stop number six of a small pub crawl, so we were probably not in the best state to write a review, but here goes.\n\nIt was early (i.e. 1900-1930) so we were the only people there. It probably kicks up a bit later on. The staff did not seem very switched on, and it too forever to make a Margarita. Other than that the beers were cold and good. \n\nA guy was there doing his quite loud sound check. Loud music is great when it's music but perhaps the sound check could have been done a. when nobody was there or b. quieter. And then we didn't get to hear any music anyway.\n\nAs I said, probably not the best timing for a great night but if the place is open you'd expect it to be firing on all cylinders. Try it later at night, might be better.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 17, 2024",
